<title>HUNGARY: Rankings of Hungary brokerages by bourse turnover. [CORRECTED 15:45 GMT]</title>
<headline>Rankings of Hungary brokerages by bourse turnover. [CORRECTED 15:45 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's State Money and Capital Markets Supervision (AETF) has published rankings for Hungarian brokerages by turnover in the first quarter of 1997, based on brokerages' reports. (Corrects to add that rankings are based on brokerages' reports.)</p>
<p>Detailed lists were released in Monday's official bourse gazette.</p>
